From 4b6d18ab430414a5fc898065076617a7763c20f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:44:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Settings app (System > Settings): brightness, pointer speed,
 desktop colour/pattern/wallpaper (BMP files, photos), clock,
 battery/volume/memory info; /proc/dsisettings (ARM7 reads the power chip,
 backlight 1..5 never off, trackpad gain); wallpaper and colour handled by
 dsdesk (long running owner of the background pixmap, SIGUSR1); battery
 indicator in the taskbar tray; saved in /home/settings.conf and re-applied at
 desktop start

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
